hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22","[AI-translation] Usayd bin Hudayr se riwayat hai, unhone kaha: Jabki raat mein wo Surah Al-Baqarah padh rahe the aur unka ghoda unke paas bandha hua tha, achanak ghode ne chlang mara. Toh wo chup ho gaye, toh ghoda bhi shaant ho gaya. Phir unhone padha, toh ghode ne chlang mara. Wo chup ho gaye aur ghoda bhi shaant ho gaya. Phir unhone padha toh ghode ne phir chlang mara. (Padhna chhod kar) alag ho gaye aur unka beta Yahya uske kareeb tha, unhe dar hua ki kahin ghoda use takleef na pahuncha de. Jab unhone use hata liya, toh apna sir aasman ki taraf uthaya yahan tak ki use dikh jaye. Jab savera hua toh unhone Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi Wasallam ko bataya. Aap SAW ne farmaya: ""Padho, aye Ibn-e-Hudayr! Padho, aye Ibn-e-Hudayr!"" Unhone kaha: Aye Rasoolallah! Mujhe dar tha ki kahin Yahya ko (ghoda) pairo se na kuchal de, aur wo uske kareeb tha, isliye maine apna sir uthaya aur uski taraf gaya. Phir maine apna sir aasman ki taraf uthaya toh ek chhat (badal) jaisa dekha jisme laltuen jaisi cheezein thin. Phir wo aage nikal gayi yahan tak ki main use dekh na saka. Aap SAW ne farmaya: ""Kya tum jaante ho wo kya tha?"" Unhone kaha: Nahi. Aap SAW ne farmaya: ""Wo farishte the jo tumhari awaz sun kar nazdeek aaye the, aur agar tum padhte rahte toh savera ho jata aur log usse nazar aate rehte, wo unse chhupi nahi rahti."" Ibn Al-Had ne kaha: Abdullah bin Khabbab ne mujhe yeh hadith Abu Saeed Al-Khudri se, unhone Usayd bin Hudayr se bayaan kiya."
"23","[AI-translation] Zaid se riwayat hai ki unhone Abu Salam ko kehte hue suna: Abu Umamah Al-Bahili ne mujhe kaha ke maine Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alayhi Wasallam ko kehte hue suna: ""Quran padho, kyunki wo Qayamat ke din apne doston (padhne walon) ke liye shafee (sifarishi) ban kar aayega. Do noorani Surat - Surah Al-Baqarah aur Surah Aal-e-Imran ko padho, kyunki Qayamat ke din wo dono aayengi jaise do badal, ya jaise do andhere ki chhatain, ya jaise par phailaye hue parindon ke do jhund, apne doston ki taraf se hujjat karte hue. Surah Al-Baqarah padho, kyunki isko padhna barkat hai aur isko chhodna afsos hai, aur jaadugar ise aab (haal) nahi sakte."
"24","[AI-translation] Jubayr bin Nufayr se riwayat hai, unhone kaha: Maine An-Nawwas bin Sam'an Al-Kalabi ko kehte hue suna: Maine Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi Wasallam ko kehte hue suna: ""Qayamat ke din Quran aur uske ahl (jin logon ne is par amal kiya) laaye jayenge, unki aage Surah Al-Baqarah aur Surah Aal-e-Imran aage honge."" Aur Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alayhi Wasallam ne un dono ke liye teen misalein pesh ki, jo maine uske baad kabhi nahi bhooli. Unhone farmaya: ""Jaise do badal, ya dono kaale siyah chhatain jin ke beech roshni (chamak) ho, ya jaise par phailaye hue parindon ke do jhund, jo apne malik ki taraf se hujjat karte hon."
"25","[AI-translation] Allah ka sabse bara naam jis se dua ki jaye toh wo ijabat karta hai, Quran ki teen suraton mein hai: Surah Al-Baqarah, Surah Aal-e-Imran aur Surah Ta-Ha mein."
